Comment: 0,0:00:00.00,0:00:00.00,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,{Source: OCR of hardcoded English subs ([1021-1022] Onigashima+ 33 - The Stars Take the Stage.mp4); opening lyrics omitted}
Dialogue: 0,0:01:21.28,0:01:24.08,Credits-207+,,0,0,0,,{\an8}Edited by fedew
Dialogue: 0,0:01:21.28,0:01:24.08,Credits-207+,,0,0,0,,{\an8}Subtitles by HatSubs
Dialogue: 0,0:01:30.00,0:01:34.80,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,I am a brawler by trade.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:35.84,0:01:37.30,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,...not even women!
Dialogue: 0,0:01:52.11,0:01:53.98,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Oiran...
Dialogue: 0,0:01:54.03,0:01:55.11,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,...Knuckles!
Dialogue: 0,0:02:03.08,0:02:05.54,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Ah, how satisfying to strike you!
Dialogue: 0,0:02:08.75,0:02:10.92,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,It must be because you're so big!
Dialogue: 0,0:02:23.35,0:02:25.93,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,My, now.\NRunning out on me, are we!
Dialogue: 0,0:02:30.19,0:02:31.81,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Maricade!
Dialogue: 0,0:02:38.78,0:02:41.45,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,The webs that barred your way...
Dialogue: 0,0:02:42.16,0:02:46.20,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,...are flammable!
Dialogue: 0,0:02:54.25,0:02:57.67,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,"Over before it even began,"\Nyou say!
Dialogue: 0,0:02:59.51,0:03:05.35,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,In you came, like a knight in shining armor,\Nto cover for the shameful Black-Leg Sanji's disgrace,
Dialogue: 0,0:03:05.35,0:03:09.23,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,but should you be\Nhandily defeated here,
Dialogue: 0,0:03:09.23,0:03:13.19,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,you will make a fool of yourself,\Njust as he did!
Dialogue: 0,0:03:15.69,0:03:19.28,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Bloom in this sea of flames,\Nif you dare!
Dialogue: 0,0:03:21.82,0:03:25.66,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Can flowers bloom\Nwithin flame?!
Dialogue: 0,0:03:27.66,0:03:28.62,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Oh, no!
Dialogue: 0,0:03:36.21,0:03:39.30,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,She's the Demon Child!\NWe can't let her live!
Dialogue: 0,0:03:39.30,0:03:41.84,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Your crime? Existing!
Dialogue: 0,0:03:43.34,0:03:45.51,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,As I told you before,
Dialogue: 0,0:03:45.51,0:03:49.47,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,you're a burden to\Nyour crewmates!
Dialogue: 0,0:03:51.52,0:03:53.90,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,A tramp like you...
Dialogue: 0,0:03:53.90,0:03:57.44,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,...is sought after by\Nthe great movers of the world.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:57.44,0:04:01.32,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,only for that\NPoneglyph-deciphering brain you possess!
Dialogue: 0,0:04:02.65,0:04:05.62,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Who needs your personality?\NThey just need you alive!
Dialogue: 0,0:04:05.62,0:04:07.95,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Nothing but means to an end!
Dialogue: 0,0:04:07.95,0:04:11.25,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,You need neither\Nyour arms, nor your legs!
Dialogue: 0,0:04:12.00,0:04:14.79,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Punching such\Nan irritating tramp...
Dialogue: 0,0:04:14.96,0:04:17.63,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,feels sooo good!
Dialogue: 0,0:04:22.80,0:04:27.60,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,See, now? Your vulgar rampage\Ncaused this raging inferno to spread!
Dialogue: 0,0:04:27.60,0:04:29.31,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,What are you going to\Ndo about it?
Dialogue: 0,0:04:29.81,0:04:37.65,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Going to ask that skeleton monster\Nto put it out again?
Dialogue: 0,0:04:38.02,0:04:42.65,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,I overheard you utter some\Nridiculous things yourself, Black Maria-san.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:42.65,0:04:44.65,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Were I you...
Dialogue: 0,0:04:45.61,0:04:47.70,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,I would flee from\Nwhere you stand!
Dialogue: 0,0:04:50.49,0:04:51.58,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Robin-san!
Dialogue: 0,0:04:52.12,0:04:53.29,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Robin-san!
Dialogue: 0,0:04:54.62,0:04:56.00,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Hey, you listening?
Dialogue: 0,0:04:56.50,0:04:57.54,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,I've been telling you...
Dialogue: 0,0:04:58.46,0:05:01.55,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,you've gotta know how\Nto throw a punch, just in case!
Dialogue: 0,0:05:02.55,0:05:07.22,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Is slapping\Nout of the question, Koala!
Dialogue: 0,0:05:07.22,0:05:08.55,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Slapping won't cut it!
Dialogue: 0,0:05:10.72,0:05:14.06,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,How about using the heel of your palm,\Nthis part of it?
Dialogue: 0,0:05:14.60,0:05:16.48,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Speed matters more than power!
Dialogue: 0,0:05:16.48,0:05:19.27,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Throw with speed,\Npull back with speed!
Dialogue: 0,0:05:19.27,0:05:20.36,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,And be like, wham!
Dialogue: 0,0:05:21.77,0:05:22.65,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Huh?
Dialogue: 0,0:05:25.45,0:05:28.53,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Robin, want me to teach you\NDragon Claw Fist?
Dialogue: 0,0:05:29.24,0:05:31.16,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Would be a great\Naddition to your arsenal!
Dialogue: 0,0:05:31.78,0:05:36.25,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,What're you doing here, Sabo-kun?!\NI'm the one teaching her!
Dialogue: 0,0:05:36.25,0:05:38.54,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Doesn't matter\Nwho teaches her, does it?
Dialogue: 0,0:05:38.54,0:05:39.83,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Then I will!
Dialogue: 0,0:05:39.83,0:05:41.25,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,No, I'm gonna!
Dialogue: 0,0:05:41.25,0:05:49.55,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,I'm more suited for it than you!\NI'm a Fishman Karate assistant instructor!
Dialogue: 0,0:05:49.55,0:05:50.97,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Oh, Hack!
Dialogue: 0,0:05:50.97,0:05:53.47,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Robin's strong enough\Nwith her locking techniques.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:53.47,0:05:57.27,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,But once we've gone our separate ways,\Nwe can't protect her!
Dialogue: 0,0:05:57.27,0:05:59.69,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,I told you she's strong, didn't I?
Dialogue: 0,0:06:00.86,0:06:04.65,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,But with Fishman Karate,\NRobin-san can really put her skills to good use!
Dialogue: 0,0:06:04.65,0:06:07.90,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Dragon Claw Fist's\Nbetter suited for that!
Dialogue: 0,0:06:07.90,0:06:10.24,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Robin has her own way of fighting!
Dialogue: 0,0:06:10.24,0:06:13.49,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Palms can be used\Nwithout special abilities like yours!
Dialogue: 0,0:06:13.49,0:06:16.54,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Dragon Claw Fist is great for practical stuff,\NI'm telling you!
Dialogue: 0,0:06:16.54,0:06:17.96,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Palms!
Dialogue: 0,0:06:18.75,0:06:21.46,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Neither of you\Nare listening to me!
Dialogue: 0,0:06:22.29,0:06:26.26,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Robin!\NI still ain't heard it straight from you!
Dialogue: 0,0:06:26.26,0:06:29.68,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Tell me you wanna live!
Dialogue: 0,0:06:31.64,0:06:37.18,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Help me, Robin-chan!
Dialogue: 0,0:06:40.06,0:06:43.36,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Never did I think that I would\Nwant to become stronger...
Dialogue: 0,0:06:43.36,0:06:45.78,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,...for the sake of another.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:46.23,0:06:51.53,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,You'll be just fine\Nif you leave it to me!
Dialogue: 0,0:06:51.53,0:06:53.07,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Huh?
Dialogue: 0,0:06:53.78,0:06:57.79,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Mind teaching me a little\Nabout that "palm" thing?
Dialogue: 0,0:07:00.54,0:07:01.62,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Okay!
Dialogue: 0,0:07:02.54,0:07:05.09,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Are you sure about\Nteaching me this, though?
Dialogue: 0,0:07:05.09,0:07:07.46,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Of course we are!
Dialogue: 0,0:07:07.46,0:07:10.84,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,You're important to us,\NRobin-san!
Dialogue: 0,0:07:15.26,0:07:16.31,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Robin-san!
Dialogue: 0,0:07:17.56,0:07:18.18,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,This is...
Dialogue: 0,0:07:19.14,0:07:20.35,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,...the ace up your sleeve!
Dialogue: 0,0:07:20.81,0:07:22.77,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,It uses your palms as well...
Dialogue: 0,0:07:22.77,0:07:25.02,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,but it's a secret art of\NFishman Karate!
Dialogue: 0,0:07:33.95,0:07:35.20,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Mil Fleurs,
Dialogue: 0,0:07:37.08,0:07:38.16,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Fishman Karate:
Dialogue: 0,0:07:49.09,0:07:50.34,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Giganteum!
Dialogue: 0,0:08:01.23,0:08:02.81,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Where were you aiming?
Dialogue: 0,0:08:04.44,0:08:05.19,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Certainly...
Dialogue: 0,0:08:06.90,0:08:10.82,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Certainly, my palms came in handy\Ncountless times.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:13.61,0:08:16.57,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Sense your opponent's core!
Dialogue: 0,0:08:17.41,0:08:20.29,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Sense my opponent's core!
Dialogue: 0,0:08:36.84,0:08:40.26,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Drat!\NThe flames are gone?!
Dialogue: 0,0:09:00.91,0:09:03.00,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,What...\NThat form...
Dialogue: 0,0:09:16.09,0:09:17.68,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,A demon!
Dialogue: 0,0:09:25.35,0:09:26.89,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Unhand me!
Dialogue: 0,0:09:36.03,0:09:40.32,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,There are people\Nwho truly need me,
Dialogue: 0,0:09:40.87,0:09:43.08,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,and rely on me!
Dialogue: 0,0:09:43.83,0:09:47.04,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,And for them,\NI would go so far as to...
Dialogue: 0,0:09:50.88,0:09:52.84,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,...become demon incarnate!
Dialogue: 0,0:10:06.73,0:10:09.60,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Gran Jacuzzi...
Dialogue: 0,0:10:09.60,0:10:10.86,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,...Clutch!
Dialogue: 0,0:10:13.19,0:10:17.07,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Black Maria-sama is\Nat peak performance today!
Dialogue: 0,0:10:17.07,0:10:19.32,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,That tramp is finished!
Dialogue: 0,0:10:26.70,0:10:29.58,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,S...top...!
Dialogue: 0,0:10:31.38,0:10:34.13,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,"Need neither arms nor legs"?
Dialogue: 0,0:10:35.92,0:10:39.05,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,No! Not mine...!
Dialogue: 0,0:10:39.05,0:10:40.93,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,I was talking about yours!
Dialogue: 0,0:10:59.03,0:11:01.07,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,What... was that noise?!
Dialogue: 0,0:11:01.07,0:11:04.53,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Black Maria-sama!
Dialogue: 0,0:11:04.53,0:11:06.79,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Damn that skeleton monster!
Dialogue: 0,0:11:10.25,0:11:13.46,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Black Maria... sama?
Dialogue: 0,0:11:18.63,0:11:22.09,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Black Maria-sama was...?
Dialogue: 0,0:11:23.05,0:11:24.93,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,It's a demon!
Dialogue: 0,0:11:33.60,0:11:37.61,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Much obliged to you all\Nfor lining up!
Dialogue: 0,0:11:38.82,0:11:41.49,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,And now...\NPhrase d'Armes:
Dialogue: 0,0:11:41.49,0:11:43.24,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Orchestra!
Dialogue: 0,0:12:03.72,0:12:05.14,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Welcome home...
Dialogue: 0,0:12:05.76,0:12:06.76,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Robin-san.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:07.26,0:12:08.76,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Glad to be home,
Dialogue: 0,0:12:08.76,0:12:10.31,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Thank you...
Dialogue: 0,0:12:11.14,0:12:12.18,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,...for waiting.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:13.31,0:12:15.98,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,I'm a little... exhausted.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:16.48,0:12:17.52,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Whoa, there.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:20.23,0:12:21.28,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Robin-san...
Dialogue: 0,0:12:27.16,0:12:30.12,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,You all actually get it, right?!
Dialogue: 0,0:12:30.12,0:12:33.25,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,That's a month's worth of my food!
Dialogue: 0,0:12:34.08,0:12:38.42,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,You'd better return the favor,\Nor there's gonna be problems!
Dialogue: 0,0:12:38.75,0:12:42.26,Captions-207+,,0,0,0,,{\an5\pos(1650,283)}Tokage Port\NUdon
Dialogue: 0,0:12:39.25,0:12:41.96,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Anyway, I can't believe\Nyou had this much food on you!
Dialogue: 0,0:12:41.96,0:12:46.22,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,My Swamp-Swamp Fruit power\Nis bottomless!
Dialogue: 0,0:12:47.14,0:12:48.30,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Straw Hat!
Dialogue: 0,0:12:48.30,0:12:50.64,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,What's happened to our captain,\NBepo, and the rest?!
Dialogue: 0,0:12:52.77,0:12:53.77,Captions-207+,,0,0,0,,{\an5\pos(957,702)}is alive!!
Dialogue: 0,0:12:52.77,0:12:53.77,Captions-207+,,0,0,0,,{\an5\pos(962,91)}...iw aaiu!!
Dialogue: 0,0:12:54.31,0:12:55.44,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,"Iw aaiu"?
Dialogue: 0,0:12:55.44,0:13:05.53,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,I am begging you!\NOnly you, Shinobu, are capable of this!
Dialogue: 0,0:13:06.07,0:13:07.57,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,His wish?
Dialogue: 0,0:13:08.37,0:13:12.08,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,I must take Luffy there!
Dialogue: 0,0:13:12.08,0:13:15.21,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,That is why I wish to go\Nto Onigashima once again!
Dialogue: 0,0:13:15.71,0:13:16.75,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,What?!
Dialogue: 0,0:13:18.63,0:13:21.88,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Why... do you speak\Nsuch ridiculousness?!
Dialogue: 0,0:13:21.88,0:13:27.38,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,I could never again let you\Nset foot upon such a dangerous place!
Dialogue: 0,0:13:27.38,0:13:28.59,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Wait, Shinobu!
Dialogue: 0,0:13:28.59,0:13:33.85,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,If nothing is done, the Flower Capital\Nand the Land of Wano will be annihilated!
Dialogue: 0,0:13:33.85,0:13:38.23,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,It is for that reason I must go,\Nno matter the cost!
Dialogue: 0,0:13:38.23,0:13:44.49,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,I beg of you!\NYou must, for our sakes-
Dialogue: 0,0:13:44.49,0:13:47.74,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,If I do this,\Nyou will never...
Dialogue: 0,0:13:47.74,0:13:50.99,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,...be able to return\Nto your current appearance!
Dialogue: 0,0:13:52.28,0:13:56.12,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,That is to say,\Nyour mind will remain that of a child...
Dialogue: 0,0:13:56.12,0:13:59.38,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,...and only your body will mature!
Dialogue: 0,0:13:59.38,0:14:00.63,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,If you follow through-
Dialogue: 0,0:14:00.63,0:14:01.67,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,I care not!
Dialogue: 0,0:14:02.34,0:14:07.59,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,I might be able to become...
Dialogue: 0,0:14:11.93,0:14:13.14,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,And yet.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:13.14,0:14:15.43,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,I cannot bring myself\Nto do such a thing...
Dialogue: 0,0:14:16.10,0:14:17.18,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Momonosuke-sama!
Dialogue: 0,0:14:17.77,0:14:19.31,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,I am begging you!
Dialogue: 0,0:14:19.31,0:14:22.06,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Y-You mustn't do that,\NMomonosuke-sama!
Dialogue: 0,0:14:22.06,0:14:24.23,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Please, Shinobu!
Dialogue: 0,0:14:24.82,0:14:27.36,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Use your Ripe Ripe Jutsu...
Dialogue: 0,0:14:29.11,0:14:31.66,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,...to make me an adult...
Dialogue: 0,0:14:31.66,0:14:37.04,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Please...\Nmake me an adult...
Dialogue: 0,0:14:37.04,0:14:40.21,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Make me an adult!
Dialogue: 0,0:14:43.09,0:14:50.84,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,The Animal Kingdom Pirates,\Nnumbering 30,000, versus...
Dialogue: 0,0:14:50.84,0:14:52.72,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,The gap in manpower quickly shrank...
Dialogue: 0,0:14:52.72,0:14:55.22,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,...thanks to\NO-Tama's Kibi Dango strategy,
Dialogue: 0,0:14:55.22,0:14:59.73,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,...and the valiant fighting by\Nsamurai and pirate alike.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:59.73,0:15:03.27,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,The resolute, top-ranking enemy officers,\Nthe Flying Six, are wiped out!
Dialogue: 0,0:15:05.73,0:15:08.86,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Onigashima, far above\Nthe Wano mainland,
Dialogue: 0,0:15:09.28,0:15:13.37,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,...will soon arrive\Nupon the Flower Capital!
Dialogue: 0,0:15:14.41,0:15:18.91,Captions-207+,,0,0,0,,{\an5\pos(1616,295)}Onigashima\NCastle Interior, Third Floor
Dialogue: 0,0:15:21.33,0:15:26.46,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Why did you serve Kurozumi Orochi,\Nthat hideous man...
Dialogue: 0,0:15:26.46,0:15:28.01,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Fukurokuju?!
Dialogue: 0,0:15:28.63,0:15:32.97,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,We ninja serve the reigning Shogun\Nto the bitter end.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:34.76,0:15:37.47,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Ninja Art: Clone Technique!
Dialogue: 0,0:15:43.60,0:15:46.02,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Such insolence!
Dialogue: 0,0:15:50.44,0:15:53.74,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,What about the man you serve?!
Dialogue: 0,0:15:53.74,0:15:55.87,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,A ghost, is he not?!
Dialogue: 0,0:15:57.08,0:15:59.20,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,You speak of Oden-sama?!
Dialogue: 0,0:15:59.20,0:16:00.96,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,The real one is there!
Dialogue: 0,0:16:08.63,0:16:12.17,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,An emotionally-laden man like you...
Dialogue: 0,0:16:12.17,0:16:15.05,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,...is completely incapable\Nof being a ninja!
Dialogue: 0,0:16:15.59,0:16:18.76,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,No matter how adept you\Nare with ninja techniques!
Dialogue: 0,0:16:22.98,0:16:27.86,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,It is thanks to our emotions...\Nthat we are sated!
Dialogue: 0,0:16:28.77,0:16:31.40,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,That day, we...
Dialogue: 0,0:16:31.86,0:16:35.57,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,...cried together,\Nlaughed together.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:36.24,0:16:40.12,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,And together,\Nwe died with Oden-sama!
Dialogue: 0,0:16:40.74,0:17:04.06,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,We are but apparitions,\Nseeking to execute our lord's will!
Dialogue: 0,0:17:04.06,0:17:08.48,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,...with Momonosuke-sama\Nas Shogun!
Dialogue: 0,0:17:12.61,0:17:13.86,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Hawkins!
Dialogue: 0,0:17:13.86,0:17:18.12,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Just how many damn substitutes\Ndo you have?!
Dialogue: 0,0:17:18.12,0:17:21.74,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,I've only a handful left...\NAh, this doesn't look good for me...
Dialogue: 0,0:17:23.87,0:17:25.54,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,I mourn those lives.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:38.09,0:17:40.55,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Bring it on, punk!
Dialogue: 0,0:18:01.24,0:18:02.99,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Only a few remain...
Dialogue: 0,0:18:03.41,0:18:05.29,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,...however,\Nwhat truly matters is...
Dialogue: 0,0:18:06.79,0:18:08.67,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,...whose lives are in them, yes?
Dialogue: 0,0:18:08.67,0:18:09.83,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Huh?!
Dialogue: 0,0:18:09.83,0:18:12.75,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,The hell's with this\Nstab wound from outta nowhere?!
Dialogue: 0,0:18:13.80,0:18:15.67,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Hey, what's with you\Nall of a sudden?!
Dialogue: 0,0:18:22.72,0:18:25.68,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Don't tell me that straw doll...!
Dialogue: 0,0:18:26.18,0:18:28.44,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Now you notice...
Dialogue: 0,0:18:29.56,0:18:36.28,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,It would have been entertaining to observe you\Nkill Kid without realizing that it's him...
Dialogue: 0,0:18:36.78,0:18:43.41,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,...but watching you\Ngrow helpless...
Dialogue: 0,0:18:45.08,0:18:48.50,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,You can kill me...
Dialogue: 0,0:18:48.50,0:18:52.25,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,...only after killing your own captain!
Dialogue: 0,0:18:52.25,0:18:53.75,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,You damned, lousy...!
Dialogue: 0,0:19:03.39,0:19:04.89,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Oh, how delightful it is...
Dialogue: 0,0:19:05.64,0:19:10.52,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,...to imagine you suffering\Nunder that mask.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:12.48,0:19:16.48,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Go on, then...\NDo your worst! I won't stop you!
Dialogue: 0,0:19:23.20,0:19:25.12,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,You are one messed up guy,\Nya know that?
Dialogue: 0,0:19:27.79,0:19:29.91,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Outta my way, Trafalgar!
Dialogue: 0,0:19:46.81,0:19:49.98,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,The price of betrayal is high!
Dialogue: 0,0:19:51.98,0:19:57.07,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Hey there,\Nex-Animal Kingdom Pirate garbage!
Dialogue: 0,0:19:57.07,0:20:01.53,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,I'm sentencing\Nall o' ya to die in a fire!
Dialogue: 0,0:20:10.87,0:20:13.42,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Where's Marco-san?!\NDo something, anything, please!
Dialogue: 0,0:20:16.92,0:20:19.84,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,He's reached his physical limits!
Dialogue: 0,0:20:21.38,0:20:23.68,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,It's up to us to do something!
Dialogue: 0,0:20:31.93,0:20:32.94,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Sangoro-san!
Dialogue: 0,0:20:33.27,0:20:34.52,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Are you okay!
Dialogue: 0,0:20:35.27,0:20:38.52,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Dammit...\Ntwo at once is freakin' rough!
Dialogue: 0,0:20:38.52,0:20:41.32,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,They're looking for Zorojuro!
Dialogue: 0,0:20:42.78,0:20:45.45,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,What the hell's\NMossbrain doing?!
Dialogue: 0,0:20:50.12,0:20:53.21,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Does he need more time?
Dialogue: 0,0:20:53.21,0:20:55.67,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,He was in critical condition\Nin the first place...
Dialogue: 0,0:20:55.67,0:20:57.33,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Chopper, Miyagi!
Dialogue: 0,0:20:57.75,0:21:01.76,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,If the drug ain't working,\Ntake that green mummy and get outta here!
Dialogue: 0,0:21:01.76,0:21:04.76,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Sanji...\NWe've already administered the shot!
Dialogue: 0,0:21:06.55,0:21:11.22,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Hang in there, Zoro!
Dialogue: 0,0:21:11.22,0:21:14.73,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,If nothing is done,\Neveryone on this floor is dead!
Dialogue: 0,0:21:15.27,0:21:17.60,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Find Roronoa Zoro...
Dialogue: 0,0:21:17.60,0:21:18.98,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,...and choke the life out of him!
Dialogue: 0,0:21:19.56,0:21:22.19,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Seems they gave him\Nsome strange treatment.
Dialogue: 0,0:21:22.19,0:21:24.03,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Don't let him recover!
Dialogue: 0,0:21:24.03,0:21:25.57,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Aye!
Dialogue: 0,0:21:34.83,0:21:36.83,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,I'm right here!
Dialogue: 0,0:21:39.75,0:21:42.46,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Sangoro-san!
Dialogue: 0,0:21:45.22,0:21:46.97,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,You little...
Dialogue: 0,0:21:48.89,0:21:51.81,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,I ain't letting you morons\Ndo whatever you want!
Dialogue: 0,0:21:56.39,0:21:59.60,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Damned monsters...
Dialogue: 0,0:22:02.52,0:22:05.40,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,The dust is so thick,\NI can barely see!
Dialogue: 0,0:22:05.61,0:22:10.20,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,I'm going to\Nremove Vinsmoke Sanji!
Dialogue: 0,0:22:10.20,0:22:11.70,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Mlem!
Dialogue: 0,0:22:11.70,0:22:15.29,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,If you had married Pudding...
Dialogue: 0,0:22:15.29,0:22:18.67,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,we wouldn't be stuck working\Nwith those idiots!
Dialogue: 0,0:22:25.80,0:22:27.97,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,It's him, Master!
Dialogue: 0,0:22:28.43,0:22:30.05,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,I see...
Dialogue: 0,0:22:31.51,0:22:32.97,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Mlem!
Dialogue: 0,0:22:33.60,0:22:37.43,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Chew on this,\Nyou Germa defect!
Dialogue: 0,0:22:39.90,0:22:44.82,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Come on ouuuut!
Dialogue: 0,0:22:48.53,0:22:51.57,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,This un's for Pedro!
Dialogue: 0,0:23:02.88,0:23:07.88,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Ain't done with ye yet!
Dialogue: 0,0:23:08.26,0:23:09.84,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Make him dead!
Dialogue: 0,0:23:09.84,0:23:12.80,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Aye!
Dialogue: 0,0:23:13.43,0:23:14.97,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,They found us!
Dialogue: 0,0:23:16.35,0:23:19.68,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Protect Zorojuro!\NHe suffered these wounds honorably!
Dialogue: 0,0:23:19.68,0:23:21.19,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Aye!
Dialogue: 0,0:23:21.19,0:23:25.94,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,They're all wounded!\NFinish them off along with Roronoa!
Dialogue: 0,0:23:26.65,0:23:30.57,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Keep up with them!\NStay strong, Miyagi, Tristan!
Dialogue: 0,0:23:30.57,0:23:31.24,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Okay!
Dialogue: 0,0:23:59.39,0:24:01.69,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,King's here!
Dialogue: 0,0:24:19.66,0:24:21.46,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Don't do it, sonny!
Dialogue: 0,0:24:25.13,0:24:27.71,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Dammit! Do I gotta do\Neverything for ya, Mossbrain?!
Dialogue: 0,0:24:33.80,0:24:36.68,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,You ain't gettin' in our way,\NBlack Leg!
Dialogue: 0,0:24:46.56,0:24:47.56,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,You're done!
Dialogue: 0,0:24:49.27,0:24:52.53,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Imperial Flame!
Dialogue: 0,0:25:04.71,0:25:06.71,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,I once heard...
Dialogue: 0,0:25:06.71,0:25:11.84,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,A long, long time ago,\Nupon the red wall...
Dialogue: 0,0:25:11.84,0:25:15.51,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,dwelled a race of people\Ncapable of igniting themselves.
Dialogue: 0,0:25:15.97,0:25:19.10,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,King the Wildfire, huh?
Dialogue: 0,0:25:21.18,0:25:23.77,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,How the hell're you still kickin'...
Dialogue: 0,0:25:23.77,0:25:25.77,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Marco?!
Dialogue: 0,0:25:25.77,0:25:27.48,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Go to hell already...
Dialogue: 0,0:25:27.90,0:25:29.86,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Whitebeard Pirates!
Dialogue: 0,0:25:29.86,0:25:33.28,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Sure...
Dialogue: 0,0:25:35.95,0:25:39.95,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,I've gotten all I want outta this.\NThis is as far as I take things.
Dialogue: 0,0:25:54.38,0:25:57.22,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,And now...\NThe real stars of this show, oh yeah.
Dialogue: 0,0:26:38.30,0:26:40.89,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Roronoa!
Dialogue: 0,0:26:47.02,0:26:48.14,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Diable...
Dialogue: 0,0:26:50.40,0:26:51.27,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Three Sword Style:
Dialogue: 0,0:26:52.31,0:26:54.07,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Purgatory...
Dialogue: 0,0:27:01.28,0:27:03.74,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Mouton Mallet!
Dialogue: 0,0:27:01.62,0:27:04.12,Captions-207+,,0,0,0,,{\an5\pos(962,90)}Demon Slash!
Dialogue: 0,0:27:29.18,0:27:32.15,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Way to go, Straw Hats!
Dialogue: 0,0:27:32.15,0:27:34.73,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,It really did\Nheal his wounds!
Dialogue: 0,0:27:34.90,0:27:37.03,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,It really did\Nheal his wounds!
Dialogue: 0,0:27:37.48,0:27:40.78,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Still...\NI fear what comes after...
Dialogue: 0,0:27:42.16,0:27:43.99,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Hey, Swirly Brow.
Dialogue: 0,0:27:45.12,0:27:48.20,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Once we've won this fight...
Dialogue: 0,0:27:48.91,0:27:51.54,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Yeah, we're gonna get to see a little bit...
Dialogue: 0,0:27:52.67,0:27:53.88,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,...of Luffy...
Dialogue: 0,0:27:54.75,0:27:57.42,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,...becoming the Pirate King!
